<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>💀 SERVIDOR #${numero} DERRUBADO</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 24px;
    font-family: ui-monospace, "Cascadia Code", Menlo, Consolas, monospace; color: #fecaca;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, #0a0a0a 0 2px, #140505 2px 4px);
  }
  .alerta {
    width: 100%; max-width: 680px; text-align: center; padding: 36px 24px;
    border: 2px solid #dc2626; border-radius: 16px; background: rgba(127,29,29,.25);
    box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(220,38,38,.45); animation: pisca 1.2s steps(2) infinite;
  }
  @keyframes pisca { 50% { box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(220,38,38,.2); } }
  .caveira { font-size: 88px; line-height: 1; }
  h1 { color: #f87171; font-size: clamp(26px, 6vw, 42px); margin: 12px 0; letter-spacing: .04em; animation: treme .25s infinite; }
  @keyframes treme {
    0% { transform: translate(0, 0); }
    33% { transform: translate(-2px, 1px); }
    66% { transform: translate(2px, -1px); }
    100% { transform: translate(0, 0); }
  }
  p { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 8px 0; }
  .missao { margin-top: 24px; padding: 16px; border: 1px dashed #f87171; border-radius: 12px; color: #fff; text-align: left; }
  code { display: block; margin: 6px 0; padding: 8px 12px; background: #000; border-radius: 8px; color: #4ade80; font-size: 16px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="alerta">
    <div class="caveira">💀</div>
    <h1>SERVIDOR #${numero} DERRUBADO!</h1>
    <p>Um ataque apagou a página da dupla <strong>${nome}</strong>.</p>
    <p>Se essa infraestrutura tivesse sido criada <em>na mão</em>, alguém teria que lembrar de cada clique…</p>
    <div class="missao">
      <p>🛠️ Mas ela é <strong>CÓDIGO</strong>. Para restaurar, rode no Cloud Shell:</p>
      <code>terraform plan</code>
      <code>terraform apply</code>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
